problems.problem:
The program below in the Pascal programming language is given. Without altering the final result of the program, rewrite it in your answer booklet, converting the nested branching structure (if..then/else) into a case structure (case..of).

```Pascal
program askisi4;
uses wincrt;
var age,epid,pedia:integer;
begin
  epid:=0;
  write('Δώσε ηλικία: ');
  readln(age);
  if (age>0) and (age<18) then
     writeln('Επίδομα: ',age *15)
  else if (age>17) and (age<=25) then
     begin
       epid := age*20;
       writeln('Επίδομα: ',epid,' και Φοιτητική χορηγία 2500 Ευρώ')
     end
  else if (age>=26) and (age<=55) then
     begin
       epid := age*35;
       write('Δώσε αριθμό παιδιών: ');
       readln(pedia);
       writeln('Επίδομα: ',epid,' και επίδομα τέκνου: ', pedia*150)
     end
 else if (age=90) or (age=95) or (age>=100) and (age<=120) then
     writeln('Συγχαρητήρια! Παίρνετε δώρο 1000 Ευρώ !!!')
 else
     writeln('Επίδομα: ',epid);
end.
```

