• i) The variable **grade** is between **1** and **100 inclusive**.
• ii) The variable **z** is an **even number** and is **not equal** to **8**.

(b) The following program in the C++ programming language accepts **10 integers** and computes and displays the numbers that are **multiples of 5** as well as **how many** such numbers there are.

The program contains logical and/or syntax errors. Write in your answer booklet **four (4)** of them, stating the number of the line in which each error appears together with the corrected statement.

```C++
